            "text": "theorem regionL {Q Q₀ : ℝ} (hQ : 20000 * Q₀ ≤ Q) (hQ₀ : 1e5 ≤ Q₀)\n    (hρ : Real.log Q₀ ≤ 0.6 * Real.log Q) {q : ℕ} (hq : 1 ≤ q) {s : ℝ} (hs : 1 ≤ s)\n    (hR : 1 ≤ Q₀ / (s * q)) (hlam : lamQ q ≤ Q₀ / (s * q)) :\n    Gq q (Q₀ / (s * q)) ≤ (Real.log Q₀ + 1.36) / (Real.log Q + cE) * Gq q (Q / (s * q)) :=",
