  "note": "As [H] (12.33), up to notation. Lean's λ(q) uses constants that are worst cases over ρ ≤ 0.6, so lamQ q ≥ the book's λ(q) and regionL covers slightly fewer R. RegionL is used only for q ≥ 2.2·10¹⁰.",
